comments.body:
@MilosKozak, you wrote: "the same is valid for your phone no data from xdrip 8:37-9:02"

Does it mean that data was received at 9:02 or 9:07? At 9:06 data was there in XDRP+ tab but not in the home tab or main screen of AAPS. Did AAPS receive missing readings at 9:02? If yes, then it is AAPS issue.

I didn't mention that "no data" happens because I was away from the phone for, in this case, about 20 minutes.

@MilosKozak, did you read my previous answer? I think that this issue is wrongly closed. 

What I didn't mention at the beginning is that this happens only if I am away of my phone for some time and no readings come to xDrip+ and AAPS. But as soon as I come to my phone and the missing reading come to xDrip+, the readings appear not all in AAPS main screen but only in XDRIP+ tab and are not taken into AAPS calculations. **After another 5 minutes of waiting, the all readings come** in the main or home screen of AAPS. **I would expect that all reading come to AAPS main screen as soon as they come to xDrip+ and XDRIP+ tab in AAPS and not first after 5 minutes.**

From my point of view, this is AAPS issue.
